### Login (ejecutar primero; guarda el token)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "prueba@ejemplo.com",
  "contrasena": "Clave12345"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Listar sin token (debe dar 401)
GET http://localhost:3000/vehiculos

### Listar con token
GET http://localhost:3000/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear vehículo
POST http://localhost:3000/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "marca": "Mercedes-Benz",
  "modelo": "Sprinter",
  "patente": "ab123cd",
  "anio": 2022,
  "capacidadCarga": 1500
}

### Crear con datos inválidos (debe dar 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "marca": "",
  "modelo": "Sprinter",
  "patente": "123",
  "anio": 1800,
  "capacidadCarga": -5
}

### Crear con patente repetida (debe dar 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/vehiculos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "marca": "Iveco",
  "modelo": "Daily",
  "patente": "AB123CD",
  "anio": 2020,
  "capacidadCarga": 2000
}

### Obtener por id
GET http://localhost:3000/vehiculos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener un id que no existe (debe dar 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/vehiculos/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Modificar
PUT http://localhost:3000/vehiculos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "marca": "Mercedes-Benz",
  "modelo": "Sprinter 515",
  "patente": "AB123CD",
  "anio": 2023,
  "capacidadCarga": 1800
}

### Eliminar
DELETE http://localhost:3000/vehiculos/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}